\b READ BEFORE INSTALLING\b0\par
\par
MyLocalBackup is a free personal project. It is not supported, and it has not been independently tested or audited.\par
\par
MyLocalBackup copies, overwrites and deletes files. It deletes old snapshots automatically, on a schedule and when the backup drive runs low on space. It \b CAN LOSE, OVERWRITE OR DELETE DATA\b0 , including files outside the backup: versions 0.7.5 to 0.9.16 had bugs that could do exactly that. Never use it as your only backup. Keep a second, independent copy of anything you cannot afford to lose, and check regularly that you can open files from your snapshots.\par
\par
By installing or using MyLocalBackup you accept that you do so entirely at your own risk, that you alone are responsible for how you use it, for choosing the correct source and destination folders and for keeping other backups, and that the authors accept no liability for any loss or damage, including loss of data. The software is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. MyLocalBackup is not affiliated with Microsoft.\par
\par
If you do not accept these terms, do not install MyLocalBackup.\par
